    description: "Add compute_stable_id() to TreeSitterAnalyzer that computes sha256({kind}:{param_count}:{arity_flags}:{decorator_names_sorted}:{containing_stable_id}). Uses classify_parameter_flags() hook for arity. Extracts decorator/annotation names where applicable. Computes containing_stable_id recursively (top-level functions use empty string). Analyzers can override entirely for special cases. See ADR-0014 §2, §5."  # 1f9c
